By \cref{prop:large-sieve-additive}, the tuple $(r, \mathcal{N}, x, (a_{n,r})_{n \sim \mathcal{N}}, A_r, Y)$ satisfies \cref{ass:large-sieve}, where 
\[
    Y := \frac{\mathcal{N} H}{|a|(H+S/S_0)(S/S_0) \min_i T_H(\alpha_i)},
