    A_r := \left(\sum_{n \sim \mathcal{N}} |a_{n,r}|^2\right)^{1/2} + \sqrt{\mathcal{N}} \sqrt{\frac{H S_0}{S} + \frac{H^2 S_0^2}{S^2}}.
\]
Since $\min_i T_H(\alpha_i) \ll_\varepsilon x^\varepsilon$,
